{"created": "2024-01-16T12:39:09.699624+00:00", "modified": "2024-01-16T12:39:10.977184+00:00", "id": 10491409, "conceptrecid": "10491408", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.10491409", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.10491408", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10491409", "metadata": {"title": "pNEUMA dataset", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.10491409", "publication_date": "2024-01-11", "description": "<p>pNEUMA is an open large-scale dataset of naturalistic trajectories of half a million vehicles that have been collected by a one-of-a-kind experiment by a swarm of drones in the congested downtown area of Athens, Greece. A unique observatory of traffic congestion, a scale an-order-of-magnitude higher than what was not available until now, that researchers from different disciplines around the globe can use to develop and test their own models.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>How are the .csv files organized?</strong></p>\n<div>For each .csv file the following apply:</div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>each row represents the data of a single vehicle</li>\n<li>the first 10 columns in the 1st row include the columns&rsquo; names</li>\n<li>the first 4 columns include information about the trajectory like the unique trackID, the type of vehicle, the distance traveled in meters and the average speed of the vehicle in km/h</li>\n<li>the last 6 columns are then repeated every 6 columns based on the time frequency. For example, column_5 contains the latitude of the vehicle at time column_10, and column&shy;&shy;&shy;_11 contains the latitude of the vehicle at time column_16.</li>\n<li>Speed is in km/h, Longitudinal and Lateral Acceleration in m/sec2 and time in seconds.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>For more details about the pNEUMA dataset, please check our website at&nbsp;<a href=\"https://open-traffic.epfl.ch\">https://open-traffic.epfl.ch</a></p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Barmpounakis, Emmanouil", "affiliation": "\u00c9cole Polytechnique F\u00e9d\u00e9rale de Lausanne", "orcid": "0000-0001-5455-6643"}, {"name": "Geroliminis, Nikolas", "affiliation": "\u00c9cole Polytechnique F\u00e9d\u00e9rale de Lausanne", "orcid": "0000-0001-6940-3607"}], "contributors": [{"name": "Geroliminis, Nikolas", "affiliation": "\u00c9cole Polytechnique F\u00e9d\u00e9rale de Lausanne", "type": "ProjectLeader", "orcid": "0000-0001-6940-3607"}, {"name": "Barmpounakis, Emmanouil", "affiliation": "\u00c9cole Polytechnique F\u00e9d\u00e9rale de Lausanne", "type": "Researcher", "orcid": "0000-0001-5455-6643"}], "keywords": ["urban", "traffic", "drones"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.1016/j.trc.2019.11.023", "relation": "isDescribedBy", "resource_type": "publication-article", "scheme": "doi"}], "language": "eng", "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "journal": {"issue": "February 2020", "pages": "50-71", "title": "On the new era of urban traffic monitoring with massive drone data: The pNEUMA large-scale field experiment", "volume": "111"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "grants": [{"code": "200021_188590", "internal_id": "10.13039/501100001711::200021_188590", "funder": {"name": "Swiss National Science Foundation", "doi": "10.13039/501100001711", "acronym": "SNSF"}, "title": "pNEUMA: On the new era of urban traffic models with massive empirical data from aerial footage", "url": "https://open-traffic.epfl.ch"}], "communities": [{"id": "epfl"}], "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "10491408"}}]}}, "title": "pNEUMA dataset", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10491409", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/10491409", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/10491409?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10491409", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10491409", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.10491409", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10491409/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://